{"suttaId":"vv71","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Vv","vriCode":"s0506m.mul","paras":[2651,2663],"vripara":"1087"},"segments":{"vv71:0.4":"Yavapālakavimānavatthu","vv71:1.1":"“Uccamidaṃ maṇithūṇaṃ vimānaṃ … pe … vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī”ti.","vv71:2.1":"So devaputto attamano … pe … yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ.","vv71:3.1":"“Ahaṃ manussesu manussabhūto, ahosiṃ yavapālako;","vv71:3.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ bhikkhuṃ, vippasannamanāvilaṃ.","vv71:4.1":"“Tassa adāsahaṃ bhāgaṃ, pasanno sehi pāṇibhi;","vv71:4.3":"Kummāsapiṇḍaṃ datvāna, modāmi nandane vane.","vv71:5.1":"“Tena metādiso vaṇṇo … pe … vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī”ti.","vv71:6.1":"Yavapālakavimānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Vv-a","bookName":"Vimānavatthu-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0506a.att","from":3174,"to":3191,"paras":[{"para":3174,"vripara":"1087","refs":["vv71:1"],"lines":["“Uccamidaṃ maṇithūṇaṃ vimānaṃ … pe …"],"lineRefs":[["vv71:1"]]},{"para":3175,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī”ti."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3176,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sopi tassa imāhi gāthāhi byākāsi –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3177,"vripara":"1089","refs":["vv71:2"],"lines":["“So devaputto attamano … pe … yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ”."],"lineRefs":[["vv71:2"]]},{"para":3179,"vripara":"1090","refs":["vv71:3"],"lines":["“Ahaṃ manussesu manussabhūto, ahosiṃ yavapālako;"],"lineRefs":[["vv71:3"]]},{"para":3180,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Addasaṃ virajaṃ bhikkhuṃ, vippasannamanāvilaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3182,"vripara":"1091","refs":["vv71:4"],"lines":["“Tassa adāsahaṃ bhāgaṃ, pasanno sehi pāṇibhi;"],"lineRefs":[["vv71:4"]]},{"para":3183,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kummāsapiṇḍaṃ datvāna, modāmi nandane vane."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3185,"vripara":"1092","refs":["vv71:5"],"lines":["“Tena metādiso vaṇṇo … pe …"],"lineRefs":[["vv71:5"]]},{"para":3186,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī”ti."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3187,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tattha gāthāsupi apubbaṃ natthi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3188,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Yavapālakavimānavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3189,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Paṭhamakuṇḍalīvimānavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3190,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Alaṅkato malyadharo suvattho</b>ti kuṇḍalīvimānaṃ.","Tassa kā upatti?","Bhagavā sāvatthiyaṃ viharati jetavane.","Tena samayena dve aggasāvakā saparivārā kāsīsu cārikaṃ carantā sūriyatthaṅgamanavelāyaṃ aññataraṃ vihāraṃ pāpuṇiṃsu.","Taṃ pavattiṃ sutvā tassa vihārassa gocaragāme aññataro upāsako there upasaṅkamitvā vanditvā pādadhovanaṃ pādabbhañjanatelaṃ mañcapīṭhaṃ paccattharaṇaṃ padīpiyañca upanetvā svātanāya ca nimantetvā dutiyadivase mahādānaṃ pavattesi, therā tassa anumodanaṃ vatvā pakkamiṃsu.","So aparena samayena kālaṃ katvā tāvatiṃsesu dvādasayojanike kanakavimāne nibbatti.","Taṃ āyasmā mahāmoggallānatthero imāhi gāthāhi paṭipucchi –"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":null}
